1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,280
Our city has started a new recycling programme this month.

2
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:07,120
Residents are asked to separate paper, plastic and glass at home.

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:10,300
Special bins will appear in every neighbourhood next week.

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,500
Officials hope the programme will reduce waste by one third.

